# The node_exporter textfile collector's directory on the Pi (H7.25, docs/target-architecture/host/h7-delete-ansible.md,
# H7.4's *textfile directory*). homelab-updater, which runs as root, writes homelab_host.prom here
# and exits non-zero without creating the directory when it is missing. This line is the
# directory's only creator on the Pi since H3.6's optimize_pi task left. M3's owner contract
# (docs/target-architecture/monitoring/m3-textfile-timer.md) is root, group {{ sys_user }}, mode
# 2775: the group lets a {{ sys_user }} writer in, and setgid keeps that group on new files.
# node_exporter.service runs systemd-tmpfiles --create on this file in ExecStartPre=, and
# systemd-tmpfiles-setup.service applies it at boot.
#Type Path                            Mode User Group           Age
d /var/lib/node-exporter-textfile     2775 root {{ sys_user }}  -
